WEBVTT

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:06.423
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tampaknya manusia akan segera dihancurkan
oleh siluman.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:14.931
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tapi ada penyihir yang berjuang sendirian
dan menyelamatkan semua orang.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:26.901
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia disebut sebagai Kaisar Sihir
dan menjadi legenda.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:31.990
<c.bg_transparent><i>Asta dan Yuno lulus</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:35.285
<c.bg_transparent><i>Ujian Masuk Kesatria Sihir yang ketat.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.079
<c.bg_transparent>"Sihir Angin, Menara Tornado!"</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:45.879
<c.bg_transparent><i>Nomor 164.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.507
<c.bg_transparent>Sungguh?</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:53.261
<c.bg_transparent>Semua kapten mengangkat tangan mereka?</c.bg_transparent>

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.806
<c.bg_transparent>Izinkan aku bergabung dengan Fajar Emas.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:02.187
<c.bg_transparent>Nomor 165.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:03.730
<c.bg_transparent>Tak ada.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:08.318
<c.bg_transparent>Itu tidak mengherankan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:11.112 --> 00:01:14.824
<c.bg_transparent>Tidak akan ada yang menginginkanmu</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>jika kau tidak punya kekuatan sihir.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.953
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan menjadi Kaisar Sihir</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>suatu hari nanti!</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.339
<c.bg_transparent>Kau pria yang menarik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:31.549
<c.bg_transparent>Bergabunglah dengan pasukanku.</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:32.926 --> 00:01:35.345
<c.bg_transparent><i>Keduanya berhasil bergabung
dengan pasukan,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:39.724
<c.bg_transparent><i>mengambil langkah penting
untuk menjadi Kaisar Sihir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.728
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan bergabung</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dengan Banteng Hitam hari ini!</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:43.978 --> 00:01:46.981
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Asta dari Desa Hage...</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:51.528 --> 00:01:53.655
<c.bg_transparent>Sakit!</c.bg_transparent>

00:01:53.738 --> 00:01:58.910
<c.bg_transparent>Selamat datang di Banteng Hitam,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>pasukan terburuk Kesatria Sihir.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:35.632 --> 00:03:37.383
<c.bg_transparent>Kau anggota baru tahun ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:38.635 --> 00:03:39.594
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa namamu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:40.345 --> 00:03:41.262
<c.bg_transparent>Yuno.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:43.514 --> 00:03:45.183
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Klaus Lunettes.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:46.809 --> 00:03:48.394
<c.bg_transparent>Kau bukan anggota kerajaan atau bangsawan,</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.106
<c.bg_transparent>tapi seorang petani dari kelas terendah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:52.732 --> 00:03:55.360
<c.bg_transparent>Apa yang Kapten Vangeance pikirkan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:03:57.195 --> 00:04:00.448
<c.bg_transparent>Bahkan jika semua kapten</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>bersedia menerimamu saat ujian masuk,</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.991
<c.bg_transparent>jangan sombong.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:05.954
<c.bg_transparent>Kau tidak akan mudah diakui</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>sebagai salah satu dari kami.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:08.039 --> 00:04:09.832
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan mencari persetujuan semua orang.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:11.209 --> 00:04:12.752
<c.bg_transparent>Kau pandai berkata-kata.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:30.770
<c.bg_transparent>Aku belum selesai!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:33.773
<c.bg_transparent>Cukup!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:36.359
<c.bg_transparent>Persiapkan dirimu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:36.442 --> 00:04:38.653
<c.bg_transparent>Aku belum siap, tapi ayo bertarung!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:40.613
<c.bg_transparent>Matilah!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:40.738 --> 00:04:41.906
<c.bg_transparent>Ini menyenangkan!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:45.910
<c.bg_transparent>Rasakan itu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:49.080
<c.bg_transparent>Ada keributan apa ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:52.917
<c.bg_transparent>Aku terlalu banyak minum. Kepalaku sakit.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:53.042 --> 00:04:54.544
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan membalasmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:56.546
<c.bg_transparent>Hampir saja.</c.bg_transparent>

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.090
<c.bg_transparent>Kau sama manisnya</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dengan malaikat hari ini.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.429
<c.bg_transparent>Jangan berisik, dasar berandal!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:11.144
<c.bg_transparent>Kepalaku sakit.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:11.561 --> 00:05:13.104
<c.bg_transparent>Mereka bertengkar lagi.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:14.647 --> 00:05:15.648
<c.bg_transparent>Hampir saja.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:15.898 --> 00:05:17.567
<c.bg_transparent><i>- Itu menakutkan.</i></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Aku pasti akan menangkapmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:20.737
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tapi mulai hari ini,
aku salah satu anggota Banteng Hitam.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:05:23.239 --> 00:05:25.033
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Asta dari Desa Hage!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:25.241 --> 00:05:28.077
<c.bg_transparent>- Senang bertemu kalian semua!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Kau baik-baik saja?</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:28.202 --> 00:05:31.664
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan menjadi Kaisar Sihir!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:31.748 --> 00:05:34.292
<c.bg_transparent>Puding yang kau simpan sangat lezat!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:34.375 --> 00:05:37.920
<c.bg_transparent>Itu makanan terakhirmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:40.423
<c.bg_transparent>Cukup!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:44.677
<c.bg_transparent>Kalian akan membangunkan adikku, Bodoh!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:45.428 --> 00:05:47.305
<c.bg_transparent>Diam, Kakak Sentimental!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:48.848 --> 00:05:52.935
<c.bg_transparent>Aku cuma ingat bertanding dengan pria tua</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk tahu siapa yang bisa minum banyak.</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:54.979 --> 00:05:56.105
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih!</c.bg_transparent>

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:01.486
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tidak ada yang mendengarkan.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:06:01.819 --> 00:06:05.782
<c.bg_transparent>Ini untuk pudingku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:12.455 --> 00:06:16.334
<c.bg_transparent>Ini terlalu berisik. Kepalaku sakit.</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:16.626 --> 00:06:18.419
<c.bg_transparent>Berhenti bergumam, dasar wanita licik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:18.503 --> 00:06:19.796
<c.bg_transparent>Apa katamu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:19.879 --> 00:06:21.130
<c.bg_transparent>Bukankah begitu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:23.216 --> 00:06:24.759
<c.bg_transparent>Dasar perjaka berandal!</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:27.470
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa yang kau sebut "perjaka berandal"?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:27.553 --> 00:06:30.973
<c.bg_transparent>Kenapa kau mati jika berpaling?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:34.519
<c.bg_transparent>Kenapa kau tidak mencoba?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.899
<c.bg_transparent>Bukankah sudah kubilang</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>kalian terlalu berisik?</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:40.191 --> 00:06:42.401
<c.bg_transparent>Atas nama adikku yang bak malaikat, Marie,</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:44.570
<c.bg_transparent>aku akan membantai kalian semua sekarang!</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:45.321 --> 00:06:46.697
<c.bg_transparent>Jangan...</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:48.616 --> 00:06:52.328
<c.bg_transparent>menghancurkan semuanya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.290
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kau yang merusak segalanya!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:02.505
<c.bg_transparent>Kapten!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:03.297 --> 00:07:04.590
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih atas kerja kerasmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:04.674 --> 00:07:05.800
<c.bg_transparent>Kapten, ini enak sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:05.883 --> 00:07:07.635
<c.bg_transparent>- Ini setengah untukmu. Hanya setengah.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Duduklah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:07.718 --> 00:07:09.637
<c.bg_transparent>- Kapten, minumlah!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Kapten, dengarkan aku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.390
<c.bg_transparent>Yami, kau bertemu pria</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>yang tidak tertahankan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:13.933
<c.bg_transparent>Jika ya, biar kubunuh dia untukmu...</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:14.016 --> 00:07:17.228
<c.bg_transparent>Kapten, kau harus bertanding</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>denganku hari ini!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:17.311 --> 00:07:19.230
<c.bg_transparent>Ya? Berikan semua kemampuanmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:19.522 --> 00:07:22.358
<c.bg_transparent>Abaikan para bocah ini</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:22.567 --> 00:07:24.402
<c.bg_transparent>dan minum denganku.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:24.485 --> 00:07:27.113
<c.bg_transparent>Kapten, mau coba ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:27.196 --> 00:07:29.031
<c.bg_transparent>Kelihatannya lezat, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:31.951
<c.bg_transparent>Maaf, aku sudah mencapai batasku.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:32.034 --> 00:07:33.828
<c.bg_transparent>Bolehkah aku menemui adikku sekarang?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.710
<c.bg_transparent>Begitu rupanya, kalian memujaku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:41.043 --> 00:07:42.670
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi itu terlalu berisik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:43.546 --> 00:07:44.672
<c.bg_transparent>- Maaf.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Maaf.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:45.298 --> 00:07:46.632
<c.bg_transparent>Aku membawa anggota baru...</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:48.301
<c.bg_transparent>Di mana dia?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:48.384 --> 00:07:50.678
<c.bg_transparent>- Tolong aku, sakit!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Di mana?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.473
<c.bg_transparent>- Tolong!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Kau bermain apa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:56.517 --> 00:07:57.977
<c.bg_transparent>Tidak.</c.bg_transparent>

00:07:59.145 --> 00:08:02.023
<c.bg_transparent>Dia anggota baru kita yang lain.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:02.482 --> 00:08:03.524
<c.bg_transparent>Yang lain?</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:06.110
<c.bg_transparent>Siapa namamu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:07.195
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:07.445 --> 00:08:09.405
<c.bg_transparent>Aku Asta dari Desa Hage.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:09.655 --> 00:08:12.158
<c.bg_transparent>Tolong beri aku bimbingan kalian!</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:12.492 --> 00:08:15.328
<c.bg_transparent>Hage? Sungguh? Yang di pinggir kota?</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:15.703 --> 00:08:17.914
<c.bg_transparent>Perkenalkan anggota lainnya kepadanya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:18.539 --> 00:08:19.457
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Kapten.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:19.665 --> 00:08:20.917
<c.bg_transparent>Biar kuperkenalkan kembali.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:21.876 --> 00:08:23.794
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Gordon Agrippa.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:24.086 --> 00:08:25.004
<c.bg_transparent>Senang bertemu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:25.421 --> 00:08:28.591
<c.bg_transparent>Dia mungkin tampak jahat,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi orangnya baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:31.844
<c.bg_transparent>Berikutnya, ada Vanessa Enoteca.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:35.014
<c.bg_transparent>Meski merepotkan saat minum,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dia orang yang baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:35.431 --> 00:08:37.683
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak merepotkan orang lain!</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:38.559 --> 00:08:41.687
<c.bg_transparent>Hage itu desa yang paling jauh, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:41.812 --> 00:08:42.647
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:48.027
<c.bg_transparent>Kau berhasil menyertai Kesatria Sihir</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>padahal dari desa itu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:48.444 --> 00:08:50.196
<c.bg_transparent>Kau pasti sudah bekerja keras,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Bocah Kecil.</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:50.488 --> 00:08:54.492
<c.bg_transparent>Mau kuberi hadiah yang bagus?</c.bg_transparent>

00:08:55.826 --> 00:08:57.870
<c.bg_transparent><i>Bagaimana bisa?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:08:57.954 --> 00:09:02.625
<c.bg_transparent><i>Hatiku milik Dewiku, Suster Lily!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:09:07.171 --> 00:09:08.631
<c.bg_transparent>Mari kita lanjutkan!</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:09.632
<c.bg_transparent>Apa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:11.217
<c.bg_transparent>Ini giliranku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:11.842 --> 00:09:13.219
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Luck Voltia.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:13.511 --> 00:09:16.847
<c.bg_transparent>Dia terobsesi dengan pertarungan,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi orangnya baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:17.056 --> 00:09:18.224
<c.bg_transparent>Senang bertemu denganmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:18.891 --> 00:09:20.142
<c.bg_transparent>Kau suka berkelahi?</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:21.519
<c.bg_transparent>Kurasa begitu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:23.145
<c.bg_transparent>Aku sangat menyukainya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:23.229 --> 00:09:25.064
<c.bg_transparent>Mau berkelahi sekarang?</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:26.816 --> 00:09:27.775
<c.bg_transparent>Hei.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:29.026 --> 00:09:29.902
<c.bg_transparent>Lihat.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.447
<c.bg_transparent>Ini adikku, Marie. Dia malaikat.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:33.823 --> 00:09:34.657
<c.bg_transparent>Baiklah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:35.074 --> 00:09:37.577
<c.bg_transparent>Dengar, jika kau menyentuhnya,</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:37.702 --> 00:09:40.037
<c.bg_transparent>- aku akan membunuhmu.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Apa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:40.121 --> 00:09:41.455
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Gauche Adlai.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:44.458
<c.bg_transparent>Dia terlalu menyukai adiknya,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi orangnya baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:45.042 --> 00:09:46.711
<c.bg_transparent>Gadis ini adalah Charmy Pappitson.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:46.794 --> 00:09:48.713
<c.bg_transparent>Nafsu makannya besar,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi dia orang yang baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:48.963 --> 00:09:50.298
<c.bg_transparent>Senang bertemu denganmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:50.715 --> 00:09:54.093
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Grey. Aku tak memahaminya,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi dia orang baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:55.595 --> 00:09:57.179
<c.bg_transparent>Senang bertemu denganmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:09:57.597 --> 00:10:01.225
<c.bg_transparent>Ini Magna Swing.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Dia nakal, tapi orangnya baik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:01.767 --> 00:10:03.060
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia menakutkan.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:07.398
<c.bg_transparent>Dan aku Finral Roulacase.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Aku populer di kalangan wanita.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:07.815 --> 00:10:11.027
<c.bg_transparent>Akhirnya, ada kapten Banteng Hitam,</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:11.402 --> 00:10:13.988
<c.bg_transparent>Yami Sukehiro!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:16.282 --> 00:10:17.950
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa dia tak akan bilang orangnya baik?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:10:18.701 --> 00:10:21.037
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih sudah menerimaku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:21.746 --> 00:10:25.082
<c.bg_transparent>Ada anggota lain, tapi mereka</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>sedang berlibur, menjalankan misi,</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:25.166 --> 00:10:27.585
<c.bg_transparent>atau bermalas-malasan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:28.294 --> 00:10:29.795
<c.bg_transparent>Cobalah akur dengan mereka.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:32.715
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, baiklah!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:33.382 --> 00:10:36.927
<c.bg_transparent>Semuanya, terima kasih sudah menerimaku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:37.261 --> 00:10:38.888
<c.bg_transparent>Kepalaku sakit.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:40.598 --> 00:10:44.310
<c.bg_transparent>Suaramu kontras dengan tinggimu, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:44.393 --> 00:10:45.269
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:45.353 --> 00:10:46.270
<c.bg_transparent>Terlalu keras.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:46.354 --> 00:10:47.271
<c.bg_transparent>Maaf!</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:48.064 --> 00:10:49.231
<c.bg_transparent>Itu saja.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:52.068
<c.bg_transparent>Kalian harus melatihnya tanpa membunuhnya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:54.445 --> 00:10:55.404
<c.bg_transparent>Jelas?</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:55.488 --> 00:10:56.364
<c.bg_transparent>Ya?</c.bg_transparent>

00:10:56.572 --> 00:10:59.659
<c.bg_transparent>Yami memintaku untuk menguatkanmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:00.242 --> 00:11:02.203
<c.bg_transparent>Kalau begitu, aku akan melatihmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:03.412 --> 00:11:06.582
<c.bg_transparent>Kau tampak lemah dan berasal dari Hage.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:09.377
<c.bg_transparent>Si Pendek dari pinggiran paling terpencil.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:09.585 --> 00:11:11.170
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak merasakan sihir darimu,</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:11.754 --> 00:11:15.549
<c.bg_transparent>dan kau anggota baru Banteng Hitam?</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:16.425 --> 00:11:20.888
<c.bg_transparent>Entah bagaimana kau bisa menipu Yami,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dasar orang udik.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:28.020
<c.bg_transparent>Kau mau jubah ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:30.106 --> 00:11:33.359
<c.bg_transparent>Jubah Banteng Hitam!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:33.484 --> 00:11:35.778
<c.bg_transparent>Keren sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:36.153 --> 00:11:37.321
<c.bg_transparent>Hebat, bukan?</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:38.614 --> 00:11:39.448
<c.bg_transparent>Kau mau?</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:39.782 --> 00:11:40.908
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, mau!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:40.991 --> 00:11:42.410
<c.bg_transparent>Tolong beri aku satu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:43.035 --> 00:11:45.538
<c.bg_transparent>Begitu, jadi, kau sangat menginginkannya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:46.705 --> 00:11:47.581
<c.bg_transparent>Kalau begitu,</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:48.666 --> 00:11:52.002
<c.bg_transparent>izinkan aku,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>sebagai adik Yami yang tersumpah,</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:52.211 --> 00:11:55.089
<c.bg_transparent>sebagai pria tergagah, Magna Swing,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk memberi cap persetujuan!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:55.548 --> 00:11:59.552
<c.bg_transparent>Kau akan menjalani</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>upacara penerimaan Banteng Hitam!</c.bg_transparent>

00:11:59.802 --> 00:12:01.637
<c.bg_transparent><i>Wajahnya menakutkan.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:12:10.479 --> 00:12:12.064
<c.bg_transparent>Jika kau, badut dari Hage,</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:17.445
<c.bg_transparent>menginginkan jubah ini,</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:17.653 --> 00:12:20.322
<c.bg_transparent>maka harus lolos uji coba ini!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:20.531 --> 00:12:22.241
<c.bg_transparent>Aku mengerti!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:27.329
<c.bg_transparent>Kita mulai lagi</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>dengan upacara yang tidak ada.</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:29.081
<c.bg_transparent>Aku juga ingin mencobanya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:30.666 --> 00:12:31.792
<c.bg_transparent>Marie...</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:32.543 --> 00:12:34.420
<c.bg_transparent>Sudah dimulai!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:34.962 --> 00:12:37.298
<c.bg_transparent>Pertama, perlihatkan tekad dan staminamu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:37.965 --> 00:12:39.091
<c.bg_transparent>Lima ribu </c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent><i>sit-up</i></c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent>!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:39.383 --> 00:12:40.301
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:42.219 --> 00:12:43.929
<c.bg_transparent>Lima ribu </c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent><i>push-up</i></c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent>!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:49.643 --> 00:12:51.520
<c.bg_transparent>Sakit.</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:51.604 --> 00:12:53.564
<c.bg_transparent>Aku belum selesai!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:55.149 --> 00:12:57.485
<c.bg_transparent>Sakit sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:12:59.528 --> 00:13:00.696
<c.bg_transparent>Sakit!</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:00.779 --> 00:13:02.156
<c.bg_transparent>Marie adalah malaikat.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:02.406 --> 00:13:04.867
<c.bg_transparent>Anak ini lumayan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:05.242 --> 00:13:06.494
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi itu semua tidak berarti.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:06.577 --> 00:13:09.538
<c.bg_transparent>Di dunia ini,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>kecakapan sihir itu segalanya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:11.499
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi dia punya banyak energi.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:14.960
<c.bg_transparent>Bagaimana?</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:16.253 --> 00:13:18.506
<c.bg_transparent>Sepertinya kau punya tekad.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:18.714 --> 00:13:20.466
<c.bg_transparent>Kau menyetujuiku?</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:20.966 --> 00:13:23.010
<c.bg_transparent>Tolong beri aku jubahnya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:23.093 --> 00:13:24.094
<c.bg_transparent>Teruslah bermimpi!</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:27.640
<c.bg_transparent>Tidak akan semudah itu, Bodoh!</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:32.311
<c.bg_transparent>Ada uji coba lain. Yang terakhir.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:33.687
<c.bg_transparent><i>Terakhir?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:13:34.438 --> 00:13:36.232
<c.bg_transparent>Sihir apa pun yang kau pakai,</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:36.732 --> 00:13:38.692
<c.bg_transparent>mana pun boleh,</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:42.363 --> 00:13:45.741
<c.bg_transparent>selama kau bisa menangkis</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>atau menghindari seranganku.</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:48.661
<c.bg_transparent>Selama bisa melakukan itu,</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:48.953 --> 00:13:52.915
<c.bg_transparent>tanpa ragu lagi, kau salah satu dari kami,</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:53.374 --> 00:13:55.084
<c.bg_transparent>dan aku akan memberimu jubah ini!</c.bg_transparent>

00:13:55.793 --> 00:13:56.919
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku sangat menginginkannya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:13:58.212 --> 00:14:00.923
<c.bg_transparent>Aku mengerti.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan melakukan yang terbaik!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:01.966
<c.bg_transparent>Diam!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:06.387 --> 00:14:08.973
<c.bg_transparent>Pendek, siapkan grimoire-mu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:09.056 --> 00:14:10.224
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.147
<c.bg_transparent>Apa itu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:17.356 --> 00:14:18.816
<c.bg_transparent>Besar sekali.</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:37.751 --> 00:14:39.044
<c.bg_transparent>Kau siap?</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:40.671 --> 00:14:42.047
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.051
<c.bg_transparent>Ini dia!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:46.135 --> 00:14:49.847
<c.bg_transparent>Aku menyambutmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:14:58.397 --> 00:15:00.399
<c.bg_transparent>- Dia punya keahlian.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Benar!</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:00.941 --> 00:15:01.984
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku bisa lolos!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:02.651 --> 00:15:05.571
<c.bg_transparent>Tapi sekarang</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:06.113 --> 00:15:07.531
<c.bg_transparent>yang sesungguhnya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:20.628 --> 00:15:22.004
<c.bg_transparent>Hangat sekali.</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:22.588 --> 00:15:24.048
<c.bg_transparent>Sihir Api,</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:32.348
<c.bg_transparent>Ledakan Bola Api!</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:33.223 --> 00:15:35.476
<c.bg_transparent>Temuilah penciptamu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:39.688
<c.bg_transparent>Apa ini?</c.bg_transparent>

00:15:41.523 --> 00:15:43.150
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tidak mungkin.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:45.653 --> 00:15:48.989
<c.bg_transparent><i>Otak Asta tahu secara naluriah.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:52.201
<c.bg_transparent><i>Asta selalu bergantung
pada otot yang terlatih,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:52.368 --> 00:15:54.286
<c.bg_transparent><i>penglihatan kinetik dan kekuatan eksplosif</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:54.703 --> 00:15:57.498
<c.bg_transparent><i>untuk mengiris sihir
dan mengalahkan lawannya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:15:58.165 --> 00:16:00.376
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tapi sihir yang Magna gunakan kali ini,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:03.128
<c.bg_transparent><i>terlalu cepat bagi Asta
untuk memprosesnya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:03.420 --> 00:16:04.463
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia terlalu cepat!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:04.713 --> 00:16:06.382
<c.bg_transparent><i>Bahkan jika dia bisa menebas,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:07.216 --> 00:16:09.426
<c.bg_transparent><i>kekuatan serangan
tidak akan hilang sepenuhnya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:09.885 --> 00:16:12.054
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia masih akan kewalahan.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:12.888 --> 00:16:14.014
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tak ada cara memblokirnya!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:14.682 --> 00:16:18.394
<c.bg_transparent><i>Otak berhenti bekerja
saat mencapai batasnya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:20.229 --> 00:16:21.313
<c.bg_transparent><i>Namun,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:22.564 --> 00:16:24.900
<c.bg_transparent><i>dia tetap punya harapan!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.946
<c.bg_transparent><i>Ingatan otot dari pelatihannya
kembali kepadanya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:31.407
<c.bg_transparent><i>Satu perjuangan terakhir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:35.202 --> 00:16:38.414
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tekad inilah yang memahat jalan untuknya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:16:55.305 --> 00:16:57.016
<c.bg_transparent>Dia memukulnya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:16:57.224 --> 00:16:59.184
<c.bg_transparent>Luar biasa!</c.bg_transparent>

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:02.521
<c.bg_transparent>Sudah lama kita tidak bertemu anggota baru</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>yang tidak perlu diselamatkan!</c.bg_transparent>

00:17:04.064 --> 00:17:05.566
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia tidak bisa memotongnya,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:05.649 --> 00:17:07.526
<c.bg_transparent><i>tapi memukulnya?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:11.572
<c.bg_transparent><i>Pedangnya bisa mengiris sihir
dan memblokirnya.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:12.823 --> 00:17:13.949
<c.bg_transparent><i>Menarik sekali.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:15.784 --> 00:17:17.828
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku tidak tahu!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:17.911 --> 00:17:19.872
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku tahu bisa mengiris
dengan sihir, tapi...</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:21.248
<c.bg_transparent><i>aku juga bisa memukulnya?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:21.331 --> 00:17:22.875
<c.bg_transparent><i>Pedang ini hebat!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:24.752
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku nyaris kehilangan nyawa tadi!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:24.835 --> 00:17:26.295
<c.bg_transparent><i>Hampir saja.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:26.587 --> 00:17:28.255
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa yang dia pikirkan?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:28.422 --> 00:17:30.382
<c.bg_transparent><i>Membunuh anggota baru?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:30.924 --> 00:17:33.093
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa dia mati?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:36.138 --> 00:17:38.724
<c.bg_transparent>Sial.</c.bg_transparent>

00:17:38.807 --> 00:17:40.225
<c.bg_transparent><i>Apa?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:40.309 --> 00:17:43.187
<c.bg_transparent><i>Dia menerima serangan penuh dariku
dan masih hidup?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:46.190
<c.bg_transparent>Untung aku bisa bereaksi</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tepat waktu, tapi...</c.bg_transparent>

00:17:46.648 --> 00:17:50.360
<c.bg_transparent>aku hampir terbunuh sihirku sendiri!</c.bg_transparent>

00:17:53.322 --> 00:17:58.452
<c.bg_transparent>Kau...</c.bg_transparent>

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:01.580
<c.bg_transparent><i>menakutkan!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:04.708
<c.bg_transparent>Kau hebat!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:08.712 --> 00:18:12.466
<c.bg_transparent>Bukan hanya mengadang sihirku,</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tapi kau kembalikan kepadaku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:12.883 --> 00:18:14.968
<c.bg_transparent>Aku menyukaimu, Cebolsta!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:16.553
<c.bg_transparent>Namaku Asta!</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:17.012 --> 00:18:20.099
<c.bg_transparent><i>Maaf meremehkanmu karena menjadi
orang desa yang lemah.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:20.474 --> 00:18:23.519
<c.bg_transparent><i>Kalau dipikir-pikir, aku juga dari desa.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:23.727 --> 00:18:25.938
<c.bg_transparent><i>Aku dari Desa Rayaka, di utara Hage.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:26.021 --> 00:18:27.731
<c.bg_transparent><i>Sungguh?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:27.898 --> 00:18:30.109
<c.bg_transparent><i>Rayaka sangat jauh!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:30.192 --> 00:18:32.152
<c.bg_transparent><i>Lihat siapa yang bicara!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:18:36.073 --> 00:18:38.617
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak punya sihir.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:40.619
<c.bg_transparent>Sama sekali tidak.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:40.702 --> 00:18:41.537
<c.bg_transparent>Benarkah?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:42.204 --> 00:18:44.123
<c.bg_transparent>Kau tidak punya?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:44.456 --> 00:18:47.501
<c.bg_transparent>Bagaimana kau bisa memantulkan sihirku</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>tanpa kekuatanmu sendiri?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:48.961 --> 00:18:49.920
<c.bg_transparent>Ya.</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:50.712 --> 00:18:52.714
<c.bg_transparent>Bukankah ini lebih dingin?</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.466
<c.bg_transparent>Jadi, kau...</c.bg_transparent>

00:18:54.925 --> 00:18:55.968
<c.bg_transparent>pria sejati?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:01.765 --> 00:19:04.685
<c.bg_transparent>- Luar biasa! Kau sangat menarik!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Mau?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:07.521
<c.bg_transparent>Jadi, ini saatnya</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>untuk bagian kedua upacara itu?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:07.646 --> 00:19:08.564
<c.bg_transparent>Apa?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:09.356 --> 00:19:10.774
<c.bg_transparent>Bertarunglah denganku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:15.028 --> 00:19:17.739
<c.bg_transparent>Nak, kau keren sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:17.865 --> 00:19:19.032
<c.bg_transparent>Ya!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:19.283 --> 00:19:20.325
<c.bg_transparent>Ini untukmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:20.659 --> 00:19:22.369
<c.bg_transparent>Ini lezat, mau?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:22.703 --> 00:19:23.620
<c.bg_transparent>Ya?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:23.996 --> 00:19:26.665
<c.bg_transparent>- Terima kasih.</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Ini, setengah untukmu.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:29.877 --> 00:19:31.503
<c.bg_transparent>Bagaimana kalau seperempat?</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:31.587 --> 00:19:32.504
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:34.423 --> 00:19:35.757
<c.bg_transparent>- Lezat!</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>- Lezat!</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:36.675 --> 00:19:37.676
<c.bg_transparent>Tenanglah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:38.051 --> 00:19:40.012
<c.bg_transparent>Ada banyak hal penting</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>yang harus kita lakukan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:40.429 --> 00:19:41.471
<c.bg_transparent>Bagus.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:42.764 --> 00:19:43.682
<c.bg_transparent>Ini.</c.bg_transparent>

00:19:45.058 --> 00:19:46.852
<c.bg_transparent>Ini milikmu, Asta.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:02.367 --> 00:20:03.744
<c.bg_transparent>Kau tidak mau?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:03.827 --> 00:20:05.287
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, aku mau!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:06.872 --> 00:20:08.332
<c.bg_transparent>Ini milikku!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:11.585 --> 00:20:13.879
<c.bg_transparent>Ayo. Cobalah.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:21.595 --> 00:20:23.013
<c.bg_transparent>Dengan ini...</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:36.944 --> 00:20:38.570
<c.bg_transparent>Cocok untukmu!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:38.987 --> 00:20:40.155
<c.bg_transparent>Bukan begitu, Yami?</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:40.822 --> 00:20:42.366
<c.bg_transparent>Kombinasi warna yang polos.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:43.492 --> 00:20:44.701
<c.bg_transparent>Sekarang kau secara resmi</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:45.118 --> 00:20:48.413
<c.bg_transparent>menjadi salah satu anggota Banteng Hitam.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:49.498 --> 00:20:53.210
<c.bg_transparent>Lakukan dengan baik. Jangan mempermalukan</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>Yami atau Banteng Hitam.</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:56.004 --> 00:20:57.214
<c.bg_transparent>Terima kasih!</c.bg_transparent>

00:20:57.381 --> 00:20:59.675
<c.bg_transparent>Suatu kehormatan</c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent>bisa bekerja dengan kalian!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:09.726
<c.bg_transparent>Luar biasa!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:10.435 --> 00:21:11.436
<c.bg_transparent>Kau berisik sekali!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:12.354
<c.bg_transparent>Maaf!</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:12.813 --> 00:21:14.648
<c.bg_transparent>Aku akan mengingatnya di masa depan.</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:14.731 --> 00:21:17.317
<c.bg_transparent>Bukankah Yami bilang kau berisik?</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:19.444 --> 00:21:21.655
<c.bg_transparent>Apa itu anggota baru lainnya?</c.bg_transparent>

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:27.744
<c.bg_transparent>Serangga Kecil.</c.bg_transparent>

00:22:58.752 --> 00:23:01.046
<c.bg_transparent><i>- Semanggi Mungil!
- Semanggi Mungil!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:02.255 --> 00:23:04.591
<c.bg_transparent><i>Tanpa suntingan, 24 jam Kesatria Sihir.</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:11.640
<c.bg_transparent>Airnya hangat.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:11.807 --> 00:23:12.766
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Yami!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:15.727 --> 00:23:16.603
<c.bg_transparent>Terlalu panas!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:16.686 --> 00:23:17.521
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Yami!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:19.272 --> 00:23:20.565
<c.bg_transparent>Aku tidak bisa melihat apa pun.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:21.483 --> 00:23:22.526
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Yami!</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:23.193 --> 00:23:24.027
<c.bg_transparent>Keluar.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:24.111 --> 00:23:25.112
<c.bg_transparent>Ya, Yami.</c.bg_transparent>

00:23:28.406 --> 00:23:31.243
<c.bg_transparent><i>Akhirnya aku diterima
sebagai salah satu anggota Banteng Hitam!</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:31.618 --> 00:23:34.121
<c.bg_transparent><i>Ada anggota baru lainnya?</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:34.871 --> 00:23:36.873
<c.bg_transparent>Black Clover, </c.bg_transparent><c.bg_transparent><i>Halaman 7,</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:37.040 --> 00:23:38.750
<c.bg_transparent><i>"Anggota Baru Lain."</i></c.bg_transparent>

00:23:39.084 --> 00:23:40.669
